      "cooked": "<p>Went to browse the store for the DHMG product lines, and each time I tried to click on an animal sub-category, I got an error screen (PC, Firefox browser)</p><p>\"Page not found</p><div>&nbsp;</div><p>The requested page \"/store/category/rabbit-sized-games\" could not be found.\"</p><p>Also, is there a breakdown somewhere of what the different animal lines mean?</p>",
