      "created_at": "2015-03-04T23:10:07.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>We could call it:</p><p>\"How to violate all the national labor laws, rip off taxpayers and get away with it.\"</p><p>But then it could be any professional sport.</p><p>What would be a great game would be a dice based fantasy sports simulator.</p><p>That would be fun, esp. if it was tongue in cheek. &nbsp;The bidding and bookkeepping, it would be the worst game ever.</p><p>And I'd love it.</p>",
